# Liten & Co — deploy exclusions.
# Nothing here is deleted or untracked. These files stay on disk and in
# git; they simply do not upload to Vercel.
#
# Rule: only surfaces that are current and in scope for the soft launch
# reach the domain. A superseded stage revision on a public URL takes
# real money at old prices.

